{"server":"cn","storyId":"act37side_level_act37side_03_beg","groupId":"act37side","stageId":"act37side_03","title":"议会公决","storyCode":"GO-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8c1f1a7426ac26bc8d4b8594ab455f0c82cb0da2f7589f4e217dac7a5c2fe08d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i17_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>当我决定为阿勒黛撰写一个单独的篇章时，一直没法弄出个满意的开头，因为我突然发现，自己对这个非常熟悉的名字简直一无所知。</i>\n<i>坎伯兰家的最后一个人，背叛了我们，却又甘愿为了救我们而牺牲的人，也是喜欢夸耀自己做的奶油炖菜汤美味的人。</i>\n<i>“铣痕”......开斯特的手下......“永远高洁的坎伯兰”......到底哪一个才是真正的她？</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆地下隧道</><p=2>1098年9月28日 4:53 P.M.</>\n距离典范军突破城内封锁还有34分钟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，坐标确认，那个匿名讯息警告的地点就在前面。信息来源刚刚也查清楚了，是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么好惊讶的，对我来说这不难猜。走吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"佣兵犹豫地站在原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弟兄们一直很信你。没有你，我们这些人不是烂在小巷里，就是被魔族佬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正都是死过一次的人，我不介意为了你拼拼命。但这事没道理，罗德岛我们根本不认识，凭什么信他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在那支典范军就快突进城里了，眼看外面就该彻底乱起来了。我们趁着这机会明明能捞很多好处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......至少你不该亲自来冒这个险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止你这么想吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"佣兵沉默，他不敢直视“铣痕”的眼睛，他害怕她发怒。\n但等了一会儿，什么也没发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场仗打完之后，你们想过伦蒂尼姆会怎么样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......和之前一样......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没有什么会再和以前一样。无论这场仗结果如何，谁都回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，老大，你想扔下我们？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我需要你们。很快，伦蒂尼姆会变成一座亟需被缝补的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的秩序已经被暴力和死亡摧毁，而留下的那些缺口，足够喂饱我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在没在问你的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好了，我不打算继续过以往那种生活，那就得早为将来做打算。当然，我不会忘了你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但想保住这口肉，就得让人知道我们能做到什么，敢做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说你们没得选。现在，你是继续走，还是回头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的，我走前面，老大。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没看错吧......这些是什么东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钢架缝隙还有炉子里的那些血红色石头，这些都是魔族佬藏在这的？！他们到底想干嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......血魔的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空气中弥漫着淡淡的血腥气味，她想起了那些如噩梦般涌来的蠕动的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！这边，我找到点东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......公爵联军的士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对劲，刚死不久。这里还有铭牌......联军第八纵队第五步兵团......校官？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马奇伯爵的部队，诺曼底公爵的人？身上没有伤口。不是被人谋害，但也绝对不是自然死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，这支部队现在明明还在城墙外围城，一个校官为什么会出现在这——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪来的？直接动手速战速决，不要耽误执行命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有其他祭坛需要启动，剩下的时间不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些该死的魔族佬把我们包围了。怎么撤——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要撤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“疯子”。\n没人知道她手中那柄属于蒸汽骑士的锋刃从何而来，更遑论“铣痕”的出身。\n佣兵的腿在抖，他很后悔。几分钟前，他本有机会活着转身就走。\n......只要那柄紫色的锋刃不会从背后捅了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我认得这个武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军给我的情报里提到了你。这么有恃无恐，难道那个大铁皮罐头也在附近吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定这次能一并解决另一个麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_1333_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你们继续手里的任务，别管我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“叮铃铃”。\n好似微风拂动陵墓梁上的风铃，安眠者面纱上垂下的金坠与宝石在空中摇曳，撞击。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，各位，请问有谁见过我丢失的耳坠吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了，小石榴——碎，碎掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那只好借用一下你的玩具了，杜卡雷。不过反正你也没法拒绝嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"钢铁间的血色祭坛方才泛起了光芒，却又立马黯淡，直至碎裂。\n而空中那几乎崩解为碎片的血红耳坠却氤氲着微光，复原如新。\n殷红炫目，不禁令人心神摇曳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“叮铃铃”。\n响声在“铣痕”的耳边回荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先替我保管好小石榴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她会引你们去该去的地方，现在，你们该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过真奇怪，凯尔希勋爵那样的人居然会相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看到了那个红与黑的身影。\n血魔。血魔为什么要救我？凯尔希勋爵？罗德岛的凯尔希医生？她们到底想要做什么？\n她有太多的困惑。可不知何时，她的手中已经握着那枚冷冽的锥形耳坠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还想帮上那人的忙，就该抓紧时间了，这附近的祭坛可不止这一处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她会告诉你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“她”？“铣痕”突然感受到了手中耳坠的震动，如同心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拦下她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜汀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*萨卡兹粗口*！"},{"type":"narration","text":"娜汀能感觉到全身的血液在刹那间向心脏倒流，晕眩感陡然降临。\n她第一次羡慕那些已经抛弃了血肉之躯的同族们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"路为你留好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的血魔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保护好她，她会引你来见我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1098年9月28日 5:21 P.M.</>\n距离典范军突破城内封锁还有6分钟"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，该去下一个地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，那个血魔的东西太诡异了。破坏掉那些祭坛后，它变得越来越......漂亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾不上了。通讯里说，典范军的队伍明明已经突进到了城内，却反而被公爵联军给拦了下来，事情恐怕有变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命令传到工厂那边的人手里了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传到了，他们在准备了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些藏起来的奇怪萨卡兹祭坛，还有突然传开的公爵们要封锁抛弃整个伦蒂尼姆的流言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我已经拿不准，真正想对这座城市动手的是谁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的还在乎是谁吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，阿勒黛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不可能短时间内解决这些麻烦，哪怕有罗德岛的协助也不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹在城内经营了这么多年，藏了不知道多少祭坛。能瞒过我，只靠他们自己不可能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放任这些祭坛启动，恐怕足以摧毁伦蒂尼姆的几个核心区域。不过，我已经找到几个关键节点并且清理掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"单靠你自己......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜需要帮助，典范军还差了最后一口气。公爵们需要听到一些真实的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于公爵们准备抛弃伦蒂尼姆的消息，是我散开的，它也并非完全的流言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想让我干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经在做了，不是吗？你的人手都已经动了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你们都还需要被推一把。我会帮你处理剩下的祭坛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......变化很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也一样吗，“铣痕”。你真的喜欢现在的名字吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你选择了活下去，那就走下去看看这条路的终点在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"担忧的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，她是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，以最快的速度赶到外围城区，通知其他人就位——准备接应典范军。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i05_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆</><p=2>1098年9月28日 5:27 P.M.</>\n典范军突破城内封锁，全城的工厂在怒吼中重启，迎接回家的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>我总是反反复复想起那个下午。</i>\n<i>工厂，维娜，蒸汽，欢呼，拳赛，怒吼，贝尔德......</i>\n<i>所有的记忆里的碎片总会一股脑地涌出来，混杂在一起，然后让我彻底记不清那个下午的所有细节。</i>\n<i>我唯一忘不掉的是，维娜说，我们到家了。</i>\n<i>我想哭，这条路走了好久，好远......从城内到城外，从战场到家乡......</i>\n<i>我们回家了，可支持着我们一路走来的人，又失去了多少呢？</i>\n<i>除了阿勒黛，又还有谁能离去后又回来呢？</i>\n<i>......</i>\n<i>我想贝尔德了。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>典范军临时阵地</><p=2>1098年9月30日 5:22 A.M.</>\n距离典范军突破城内封锁已经过去2天"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来物资清点是这么痛苦的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去盘算我们地盘里厂子的物资也没有这么磨人吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这要是算痛苦的话，我倒希望能再苦一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，不过确实蛮让人兴奋的，原来还有这么多人愿意支持我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）折腾太久了，都天亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......得加快速度了，不能拖太久。其他人能为我们争取的时间不会太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按维什戴尔那边传回来的消息，军事委员会的整个指挥系统被他们搅了个乱七八糟，但食腐者军队还在西部大堂区域严阵以待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们进城已经两天，但他们至今还没大动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是有消息说特雷西斯已经抛下他们躲起来了吗？说不定食腐者他们一直没动静就是这个原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是猜测而已，甚至连博士他们都还没有确切的消息可以证实这个说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，去休息一下吧。联军的总攻信号很快就会来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，我只是没那么喜欢点数！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想去帮达格达。至少在说服更多市民加入我们抢回场子这件事上，我比她更有经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩在说服那些犹豫的贵族，汉娜和凯瑟琳在联合剩余的工人和自救军，我相信她们都能搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但达格达......不是适合这种任务的性子，她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续吧。这边是海蒂小姐支援的物资......还有这些自救军偷偷造的武器......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"压在最下面......这是谁送过来的？清单里没有啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她环顾了四周，除了来往搬运物资的典范军成员，她没有发现任何身份不明的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在警惕地确认这份来源不明的物资并无威胁后，维娜好奇地打开了箱子，取出了其中的东西。\n她愣住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i03_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"一套......衣服？\n初升太阳的光线仍然带有一丝寒意，落在了一枚家徽之上——\n“维多利亚家族”，她的家族。\n维娜感到了愤怒，这是什么卑劣的恶作剧吗？\n不......不对——\n她摩挲着这套衣物，她认得它的样式......它曾属于维多利亚的王室。\n可它为什么会出现在这里？是谁找到了它，又将它送到自己手中？\n在她的脑海中，只有一个名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的战备资源比起联军要差上不少。那些公爵们铁了心让典范军打头阵，他们的伤亡不会小......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但对他们来说是一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵们想要一个英雄，民众们需要一个英雄，那我何不帮这段故事再添加一点风味呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想赌他们能赢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赌？不，点数早在城墙下那场大战结束时就注定了。现在，无非是各方趁着最后的时机来加注罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我不懂，反正信你就对了。接下来该干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等决战一起，城里该乱起来了。想趁着这时候“干点大事”的人不会少，但我不想看到有人把手伸到我的面前来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警惕的佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......话说，老大，你留下的东西到底是个啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，让传说更有说服力的道具——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i03_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"“属于王室的衣服，从坎伯兰公爵府废墟里抢救出来的。那位典范军的首领能用上。”\n“先王的遗孤回到故土，以王的姿态驱逐魔族......你不喜欢这个故事吗？”\n“可老大......我听说她挺瞧不上这名头？”\n“如果她真想说服那些还在摇摆的人，她就需要这个名头......”\n“至少现在需要。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她是否还活着——\n自蒸汽骑士再度出现那天起，维娜的心中便一直存在着某个侥幸。或许身边的人心中都有，但没人会说出来。\n她紧张地环顾了周围，却没有看到那个人的身影......\n维娜反倒松了一口气，她完全没有准备好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......一张纸条？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“按你的尺寸改了改，希望还合身。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i03_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有落款。\n但她却终于第一次能够确认，阿勒黛，还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"里面还有其他东西？这是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"几张照片，还有写在背后的几句话。\n“顺便找到些说不定对你有用的证据，是关于某位公爵的。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
